; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR MORSE SENDER v18  -  type it, it goes out on Q as a 700 Hz tone   ($4000, VM1)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot. Choose a speed (5-25 words per minute, Enter = 12), then type
; a line and press Enter: it is sent as Morse on the Q line - and so on anything
; wired to Q - with each character on the hex display and on the terminal with
; its dots and dashes. Enter on an empty line quits. Correct timing: dash 3
; dots; gaps 1 / 3 / 7. v18: every dot and dash is a 700 Hz TONE on Q (a speaker
; on Q buzzed, not clicked) - a native routine at $4E00 (RUNMC) toggles Q.
; PITCH: change the byte at $4E42 (D 4E40 line, third byte; 2A = 700 Hz at 3 MHz;
; larger = lower: half-period = 16 + 6 x it machine cycles).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/morse_tx18_verify.py, V0061.35): PASS 2026-10-02 (sim, morse_tx18_verify.py): 12 WPM dot 99.3 ms, 699.6 Hz; 25 WPM dot 47.9 ms; 5 WPM dot 239.4 ms; dash 3.0x, gaps 1/3/7 within 5%
;
; 176 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000
; D 4009 0A 00          SETQ 00                            Q off to start
; D 400B 11 0E 06 00    LOADXI R14 0600
; D 400F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; ASK:
; D 4011 11 0E 06 B0    LOADXI R14 06B0
; D 4015 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4017 11 0C 0A 00    LOADXI R12 0A00
; D 401B 11 0D 0A 00    LOADXI R13 0A00
; D 401F C2 CD          GETSTR R12 R13                     the number
; D 4021 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000
; D 4025 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; DIG:
; D 4029 2E 01 0A 00    READIDX R1 0A00                    next character
; D 402D 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 402F 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 4031 A0 00 56       IFTRUEI DGD
; D 4034 11 09 00 30    LOADXI R9 0030
; D 4038 89 79          TESTLXY R7 < R9
; D 403A A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK                        not a digit: ask again
; D 403D 11 09 00 3A    LOADXI R9 003A
; D 4041 88 79          TESTGXY R7 >= R9
; D 4043 A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK
; D 4046 53 07 00 30    SUBXI R7 0030
; D 404A 4A 5F          MULTXY R5 * R15
; D 404C 21 15          COPYAX MA -> R5                    W x 10
; D 404E 50 57 05       ADDXYZ R5 + R7 -> R5               + the digit
; D 4051 42 01          INCX R1
; D 4053 B0 00 29       GAL DIG
; DGD:
; D 4056 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 4058 A1 00 5F       IFFALSEI HAVE
; D 405B 11 05 00 0C    LOADXI R5 000C                     Enter alone: 12
; HAVE:
; D 405F 11 09 00 05    LOADXI R9 0005
; D 4063 89 59          TESTLXY R5 < R9
; D 4065 A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK
; D 4068 11 09 00 1A    LOADXI R9 001A
; D 406C 88 59          TESTGXY R5 >= R9
; D 406E A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK
; D 4071 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 4074 11 0A 00 02    LOADXI R10 0002
; D 4078 4D 9A          DIVXY R9 / R10
; D 407A 25             COPYMAA
; D 407B 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 407D 52 09 01 2F    ADDXI R9 012F
; D 4081 4D 95          DIVXY R9 / R5
; D 4083 25             COPYMAA
; D 4084 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6                   R6 = ticks per dot
; D 4086 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 4089 11 0A 00 02    LOADXI R10 0002
; D 408D 4D 9A          DIVXY R9 / R10
; D 408F 25             COPYMAA
; D 4090 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4092 52 09 06 90    ADDXI R9 0690
; D 4096 4D 95          DIVXY R9 / R5
; D 4098 25             COPYMAA
; D 4099 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 409B 11 0A 0E 44    LOADXI R10 0E44
; D 409F 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)               HPU = half-periods per unit
; D 40A2 10 00 2A       LOADAI 002A
; D 40A5 2F 0B 0E 42    WRITEIDX R11 0E42                  the pitch: 700 Hz
; D 40A9 11 0E 06 E1    LOADXI R14 06E1
; D 40AD C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40AF 23 00 54       COPYXY R5 -> R4
; D 40B2 BD 01 C6       CALL PRNUM
; D 40B5 11 0E 06 EF    LOADXI R14 06EF
; D 40B9 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; LINE:
; D 40BB 11 0E 07 04    LOADXI R14 0704
; D 40BF C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40C1 11 0C 0A 00    LOADXI R12 0A00
; D 40C5 11 0D 0A 00    LOADXI R13 0A00
; D 40C9 C2 CD          GETSTR R12 R13                     what to send
; D 40CB 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; D 40CF 2E 01 0A 00    READIDX R1 0A00
; D 40D3 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 40D5 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 40D7 A0 01 AA       IFTRUEI QUIT                       empty: quit
; D 40DA 11 0E 07 0D    LOADXI R14 070D
; D 40DE C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; CH:
; D 40E0 2E 01 0A 00    READIDX R1 0A00
; D 40E4 21 03          COPYAX Acc -> R3
; D 40E6 8C 03          TESTXZ R3
; D 40E8 A0 01 A7       IFTRUEI EOL
; D 40EB 11 09 00 61    LOADXI R9 0061
; D 40EF 89 39          TESTLXY R3 < R9
; D 40F1 A0 01 01       IFTRUEI UP
; D 40F4 11 09 00 7B    LOADXI R9 007B
; D 40F8 88 39          TESTGXY R3 >= R9
; D 40FA A0 01 01       IFTRUEI UP
; D 40FD 53 03 00 20    SUBXI R3 0020                      lower case -> upper
; UP:
; D 4101 86 03 00 20    TESTXI R3 0020
; D 4105 A1 01 1F       IFFALSEI NSP
; D 4108 CA 20          SEROUTI 20                         a space: the word gap
; D 410A CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 410C 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 410F 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4
; D 4112 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4               4 units - plus the 3 after the letter = 7
; D 4115 53 04 00 04    SUBXI R4 0004                      less the fixed work around it
; D 4119 BD 01 B6       CALL WAIT
; D 411C B0 01 A2       GAL NXT
; NSP:
; D 411F 11 09 00 20    LOADXI R9 0020
; D 4123 89 39          TESTLXY R3 < R9
; D 4125 A0 01 A2       IFTRUEI NXT                        control characters: skip
; D 4128 11 09 00 60    LOADXI R9 0060
; D 412C 88 39          TESTGXY R3 >= R9
; D 412E A0 01 A2       IFTRUEI NXT
; D 4131 23 00 32       COPYXY R3 -> R2
; D 4134 53 02 00 20    SUBXI R2 0020
; D 4138 11 09 00 08    LOADXI R9 0008
; D 413C 4A 29          MULTXY R2 * R9
; D 413E 21 12          COPYAX MA -> R2                    slot = (char - $20) x 8
; D 4140 2E 02 0C 00    READIDX R2 0C00
; D 4144 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 4147 A0 01 A2       IFTRUEI NXT                        no Morse for it: skip
; D 414A 22 03          COPYXA R3 -> Acc
; D 414C 05 00          OUTA 00                            the character on the hex display
; D 414E 22 03          COPYXA R3 -> Acc
; D 4150 C9             SEROUT                             and on the terminal
; D 4151 CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; EL:
; D 4153 2E 02 0C 00    READIDX R2 0C00                    the next element
; D 4157 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 4159 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 415B A0 01 91       IFTRUEI EOC
; D 415E 22 07          COPYXA R7 -> Acc
; D 4160 C9             SEROUT                             '.' or '-' on the terminal
; D 4161 11 09 0E 44    LOADXI R9 0E44
; D 4165 39 02 94       COPYMXY M(R9) -> R4                R4 = half-periods in a unit
; D 4168 86 07 00 2D    TESTXI R7 002D
; D 416C A1 01 78       IFFALSEI DOT
; D 416F 23 00 49       COPYXY R4 -> R9
; D 4172 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4
; D 4175 50 49 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R9 -> R4               a dash: 3 units
; DOT:
; D 4178 11 09 0E 40    LOADXI R9 0E40
; D 417C 3A 02 49       COPYXMY R4 -> M(R9)
; D 417F F1 4E 00       RUNMC 4E00                         the tone: Q toggled at 700 Hz, then off
; D 4182 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 4185 53 04 00 02    SUBXI R4 0002
; D 4189 BD 01 B6       CALL WAIT                          the 1-unit gap after every element
; D 418C 42 02          INCX R2
; D 418E B0 01 53       GAL EL
; EOC:
; D 4191 CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 4193 CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 4195 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 4198 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4               2 more units: 3 between letters
; D 419B 53 04 00 08    SUBXI R4 0008
; D 419F BD 01 B6       CALL WAIT
; NXT:
; D 41A2 42 01          INCX R1
; D 41A4 B0 00 E0       GAL CH
; EOL:
; D 41A7 B0 00 BB       GAL LINE
; QUIT:
; D 41AA 11 0E 07 10    LOADXI R14 0710
; D 41AE C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 41B0 0A 00          SETQ 00
; D 41B2 00             HALT
; D 41B3 F0 00 00       BREAK
; WAIT:
; D 41B6 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 41B8 A0 01 C4       IFTRUEI WX
; WL:
; D 41BB C0 01          DLYI 01
; D 41BD 43 04          DECX R4
; D 41BF 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 41C1 A1 01 BB       IFFALSEI WL
; WX:
; D 41C4 BE 00          RETURN
; PRNUM:
; D 41C6 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; PN1:
; D 41CA 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 41CC 27             COPYREMA
; D 41CD 70 00          PUSHA Acc                          digits onto the stack
; D 41CF 42 08          INCX R8
; D 41D1 25             COPYMAA
; D 41D2 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 41D4 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 41D6 A1 01 CA       IFFALSEI PN1
; PN2:
; D 41D9 71 00          POPA Acc
; D 41DB 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41DE C9             SEROUT
; D 41DF 43 08          DECX R8
; D 41E1 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 41E3 A1 01 D9       IFFALSEI PN2
; D 41E6 BE 00          RETURN

